# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Supplier Intelligence Platform — Environment Vars
# Copy to .env and fill in values
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ──── Database (PostgreSQL + TimescaleDB) ────
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=sie_analytics
DB_USER=sie_admin
DB_PASSWORD=sie_secure_password_change_me
DB_POOL_SIZE=10
DB_MAX_OVERFLOW=20
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://${DB_USER}:${DB_PASSWORD}@${DB_HOST}:${DB_PORT}/${DB_NAME}

# ──── Kafka ────
KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS=localhost:9092
KAFKA_SECURITY_PROTOCOL=PLAINTEXT
KAFKA_CONSUMER_GROUP_PREFIX=sie

# ──── Ingestion API ────
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000
API_GRPC_PORT=50051
API_KEY=sie-api-key-change-me
API_LOG_LEVEL=INFO
API_CORS_ORIGINS=["http://localhost:8501","http://localhost:3000"]

# ──── Airflow ────
AIRFLOW__CORE__EXECUTOR=LocalExecutor
AIRFLOW__DATABASE__SQL_ALCHEMY_CONN=postgresql://${DB_USER}:${DB_PASSWORD}@${DB_HOST}:${DB_PORT}/airflow
AIRFLOW__CORE__FERNET_KEY=your-fernet-key-here
AIRFLOW__CORE__DAGS_FOLDER=/opt/airflow/dags
AIRFLOW__CORE__LOAD_EXAMPLES=false
AIRFLOW__WEBSERVER__WEB_SERVER_PORT=8081

# ──── Edge Simulator ────
SIMULATOR_GRPC_TARGET=localhost:50051
SIMULATOR_SPEED=1.0
SIMULATOR_ANOMALY_RATE=0.05

# ──── Computer Vision ────
CV_MODEL_PATH=src/cv_module/models/best.pt
CV_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.5
CV_IMAGE_STORAGE_PATH=./data/inspection_images

# ──── Agentic AI ────
AI_PROVIDER=openai
# OpenAI
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o
# AWS Bedrock (alternative)
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-access-key
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-secret-key
BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=anthropic.claude-3-sonnet-20240229-v1:0

# ──── Dashboard (Streamlit) ────
DASHBOARD_DB_QUERY_CACHE_TTL=30
DASHBOARD_AUTO_REFRESH_SECONDS=30
DASHBOARD_THEME=dark

# ──── Logging ────
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
LOG_FORMAT=json
